\item Patient Facts || Exploratory, Cross-Sectional
\item Expected Variables Present || Exploratory, Cross-Sectional
\item Expected Variables Present || Anomaly Detection, Cross-Sectional
\item Expected Variables Present || Anomaly Detection, Longitudinal
